# Agent rule spokes for other projects: compiled outputs that belong in their
# own repositories (see 0a0439c). Only the Core Hub files stay tracked.
/agents/AGENTS.*.md
!/agents/AGENTS.latest.md
!/agents/AGENTS.global.md
!/agents/AGENTS.cloudflare.md
!/agents/AGENTS.security.md
!/agents/AGENTS.ui.md
